<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-24T23:34:15.903Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces have begun airstrikes and ground assaults against Haitian gang leaders, targeting strongholds and resulting in gang casualties. Haitian police raids in Port-au-Prince have also eliminated suspected gang members, while two Salvadoran soldiers died while handling explosives during the operations. The UN chief condemned a recent attack that caused dozens of civilian deaths, and the EU imposed sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQSjltVnJJcnNTX0ljRm1SQjEtVTZNbE1TVld4dnJMQk15dW10YjY3Uk1Ga25LN0JFYmdOTm9RQlF1TmUyUlp2TnI1YU15d3VOX2NGajBDWmh4M19sUG11NmprUXFPdkJ4aTh4S0ZGOVk5R2hnYlF0TWExRDRheHYtMjN3Q1JtWHVhZ3hoLVVWVTBzU21KR2NQc1ZrY2g5QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPZnRnanpKR0hRWHBWU3pGMVI5bU1GV0IyYU1Fb3dZWDZ4eXdzWG1qYTEtN192a0ZVRFJFalFlLVlOZGVXTXBjY1BBMkx6Z3lNQ2VRSXpkWW5WdENoeGVWZUk3T1F6ck03bUpyczB3NFVzaVpSd3RiSFRiWWRfcUJ6alFja2M4WXota1JNMTNnbURpSmVIYmRvVmp5bkU5OGdtTzNMRHE3cXlnUVRCYy1vb1NnQ3JkbVJ4T2NXa3VlU2trdFZHWXNfb0xBeHhaUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQTnk1VVA1N2trZF9JVnNhVzEzVEVEQ2gycmVPQWkwcExKQW5xYUZ1VnQzb3FWcGpKeFdCMnRuSWhxdnNURFhzVTVqWHRoemJHVGx2RzgtdktTbkhXd3RSNFF2RTd3V3BhWTJkdDdSSi1MRWp4ZmhjTHAtZkRPcXBrRk5ueTlxZkg2UWgyM3RMSGVERW5XNldRYkIwMGFKQlY5czZiU09DNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5PMWk5QVJjd2pwbG1KWEx6ZGtESnVfRERxWkZfRjRhU0FJUGlnOEJFa1RnbWtyNXY4c1d6aUt1dGJIdEZNYlVtdkwyeXRUdXNSdTFWSXZtajU?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &l